    "description": "The Loyalty Transfer API enables businesses to manage the transfer of loyalty points between customers efficiently. This endpoint allows authorized users to update loyalty balances by transferring points from one account to another. Typical consumers include customer service teams and loyalty program managers who facilitate customer interactions and maintain the integrity of loyalty programs. This API ensures seamless point transfer operations, vital for enhancing customer retention and satisfaction in loyalty programs.",
